Package: en-ua-switcher
Version: 0.2.3
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: EnUa contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-xlib, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, gir1.2-atspi-2.0, libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, python3-enchant, hunspell-en-us, hunspell-uk
Description: Automatic English/Ukrainian keyboard layout correction
 A quiet offline X11 background utility that fixes recognised words typed
 in the wrong English or Ukrainian keyboard layout after a released Space.
 Includes a tray icon, pause, sign-in startup and application exclusions.
